<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Guardian H1 share falls, div up.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Guardian H1 share falls, div up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr ended June 30</p>
<p>		(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)		 297.3    vs 348.5</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 200.0    vs 167.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   30.26    vs 35.44</p>
<p>    Pre tax		   26.78    vs 40.34</p>
<p>    Gross premium income  891.38   vs 771.37</p>
<p>    Underwriting loss     16.51    vs 0.40</p>
<p>    Investment income     42.94    vs 40.74</p>
<p>Div payable September 26</p>
<p>On register August 29</p>
<p>Full name: Guardian National Insurance Co Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Following corrective action, directors said that they were hopeful of an improved performance in the second half of the year despite ongoing costs associated with the group's new distribution operation.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
